        <h2>My background</h2>
        <p>I am a Colombian engineer currently based in Luxembourg,
        with a background in Mechanical and Industrial Engineering
        and a passion for creating practical solutions to engineering challenges.</p>
        <p>My experience ranges from medical engineering and manufacturing
        to robotics and automation. I enjoy working across disciplines,
        combining mechanical design, electronics and software to turn
        ideas into functional systems.</p>
        <p>I am currently pursuing a Master's degree in Space Technologies
        and Business at the University of Luxembourg, while contributing
        to robotics research at the SpaceR Research Group.</p>
        <p>Curious by nature and always eager to learn, I enjoy taking on
        new challenges, exploring new technologies and turning knowledge
        into real-world applications.</p>
